<title>USA: Gloucester Cty, N.J., agency ylds 5.60 pct in 2024.</title>
<headline>Gloucester Cty, N.J., agency ylds 5.60 pct in 2024.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets</p>
<p>Corp said Thursday it tentatively priced $21.5 million</p>
<p>Gloucester County Utilities Authority, N.J., refunding bonds</p>
<p>at a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2024.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
